    "impactStatement": {
      "content": "WE EXPAND EDUCATIONAL ACCESS AND OPPORTUNITY, USING EVERYTHING ABOUT THE SPORT WE LOVE TO HELP THE STUDENTS WE LOVE CHASE THEIR BOLDEST DREAMS. Our students steadily progress as scholars, athletes, and teammates from middle school through high school, each graduating with lacrosse techniques, life skills, and an actionable plan for pursuing a college degree or entering the workforce. Our staff is satisfied by their work, appreciated for their efforts, and able to become more effective in their roles – whether that’s coaching students, coaching coaches, or coaching communities. Everyone on the team owns their role as a vital contributor to our sustainable business model. Schools are enriched by our added support, our communities are energized with more play, and our network grows with college and career-ready Harlem Lacrosse alumni. Ultimately, there are fewer barriers to fields, classrooms, and board rooms, and each space is strengthened with greater diversity."
    },
